BT 1 0 0 1 0 142.8 Tm /F1 14 Tf 19.6 TL (By Miles Ridge. Feature article, DRAFT v0.3, November 11, 2026. Target:) Tj T* (wyovote.com. Companion to A010 v0.3 Official State Symbols.docx. v0.3 is an) Tj T* (edit pass at the owner's request: the flag line now ends in "unbranded," and the) Tj T* (piece uses a few more tongue-in-cheek, double-meaning ranch and range) Tj T* (words tied to specific symbols; repetition is trimmed so each point is stated) Tj T* (once; the closer lands a new beat. All facts, sources, and the lead photograph) Tj T* (are unchanged from v0.1 and v0.2. No MTR Research data, no private data,) Tj T* (and no draft or unreviewed internal reports are used.) Tj T* ET
