BT 1 0 0 1 0 182 Tm /F1 14 Tf 19.6 TL -0.006615 Tw (A010 is a short family explainer of Wyoming's official state symbols and the fact) Tj T* 0 Tw (that the Legislature wrote them into law. The Word article is meant for parents) Tj T* (and children. It still uses a short list of well-known symbols rather than a) Tj T* (complete catalog. v0.1 was accurate but dry. v0.2 rewrote the prose with more) Tj T* (color and wry Western voice. The owner then asked for a little tongue-in-cheek) Tj T* (wordplay, starting with a change from "unmarked" to "unbranded" on the flag,) Tj T* (and to look for other opportunities. v0.3 also follows the standing rule from) Tj T* (A009: say each point once and do not repeat it; the closer should land a new) Tj T* (beat. Facts, sources, photograph, and order are unchanged. Humor is) Tj T* (commentary, not a new claim.) Tj T* ET
